{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_170_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_170","textTraditional":"一、二十年，春，王正月，辛亥，仲孫速會莒人，盟於向。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_170_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_170","textTraditional":"二、夏，六月，庚申，公會晉侯、齊侯、宋公、衞侯、鄭伯、曹伯、莒子、邾子、滕子、薛伯、杞伯、小邾子，盟於澶淵。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_170_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_170","textTraditional":"三、秋，公至自會。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_170_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_170","textTraditional":"四、仲孫速帥師伐邾。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_170_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_170","textTraditional":"五、蔡殺其大夫公子濕，蔡公子履出奔楚。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_170_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_170","textTraditional":"六、陳侯之弟光出奔楚。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_170_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_170","textTraditional":"諸侯之尊，弟兄不能以屬通。其弟云者，親之也。親而奔之，惡也。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_170_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_170","textTraditional":"七、叔老如齊。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_170_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_170","textTraditional":"八、冬，十月，丙辰，朔，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_170_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_170","textTraditional":"九、季孫宿如宋。","sentenceOrder":10}],"overrides":{}}